# acl — Mosquitto access control list (CONTRACTS.md §1).
#
# Mounted read-only at /mosquitto/config/acl. With allow_anonymous false and
# no default (userless) section, any user or topic not listed here is denied.
#
# "write" = publish only; "read" = subscribe/receive only.

# Simulator: publish-only on the telemetry namespace.
user egw-simulator
topic write c2dt/#

# Controller: subscribe/read-only on the telemetry namespace.
user egw-controller
topic read c2dt/#
